{"id":"wozu","lemma":"wozu","pos":"adv","rank":672,"glosses":["for what reason, to what purpose, what for, why?","to what, for what, etc.","for which reason, to which purpose"],"ipa":"/voːˈt͡suː/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c9/De-wozu.ogg/De-wozu.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Wozu sind wir hier?","en":"What are we here for?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/222291","words":[null,{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"Wozu willst du das tun?","en":"What do you want to do that for?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/711681","words":[null,{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to do"}]},{"text":"Wozu ist es gut?","en":"What is it for?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/230330","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"good"}]},{"text":"Wozu brauchen wir Waffen?","en":"Why do we need weapons?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/760155","words":[null,{"g":"to need"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"weapon, arm","l":"Waffe"}]},{"text":"Wir wissen, wozu du fähig bist.","en":"We know what you're capable of.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to know"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"capable"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"}]}]}